182:Fix an integer $h\geq 2$ and a prime power $q$, and set $M:=q^h-1$. Let $\tau$ be a multiplicative generator of $\FF_{q^h}^\times$ (not necessarily in line with the Conway polynomial). Take $\beta\in \FF_{q^h}$ with algebraic degree $h$.
