380:Computing $R_2^{-1}(k)$ is an old game already~\cite{1906.Veblen}. Babcock~\cite{1953.Babcock} computed by hand for $k\le 10$ (his value of $R_2^{-1}(10)$ is incorrect). More recently, the OGR Project~\cite{OGR} has computed $R_2^{-1}(28)=585$; the computation took $8.5$ years on thousands of machines. We refer the reader to the Wikipedia page for Golomb Rulers~\cite{wikiGolomb} for $R_2^{-1}(k)$ for $k\le 28$ and for the sets that are optimal.
