- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2308.12406/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The result is not yet shippable: all three required oracle runs received HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” so no model responses or hardening verdict exist. No `REJECTED.md` was created because this is an infrastructure blockage, not a failure of G, H, or V. Restore the OpenRouter allowance and rerun the bare, hinted, and placebo harnesses.
